      <p begin="00:00.470" end="00:02.280" ttm:agent="v1">Baby girl, you know what I want</p>
      <p begin="00:02.280" end="00:04.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Let me do it to you, do it to you (do it to you)</p>
